OL,3,A'Ironing board' seats to be replaced on
OL,4,AThameslink
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 60,000 seats on Thameslink
OL,7,Ftrains are set to be upgraded as part
OL,8,Fof plans announced by Greater
OL,9,FThameslink Railway (GTR), less than 100
OL,10,Fdays after it came under public
OL,11,Fownership.
OL,13,FAll 115 Thameslink trains will get new
OL,14,Fseat cushions and backrests, replacing
OL,15,Fthe much-criticised seats dubbed
OL,16,F"ironing boards" by passengers.
OL,18,FThe work is expected to begin in 2027
OL,19,Fand take place over a two-year period.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,113,105,200,300,0,100
