OL,3,A'Ironing board' seats to be replaced on
OL,4,AThameslink
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst-class seats would also receive
OL,7,Fupgraded seat cushions, while seat-back
OL,8,Ftables would be installed on the 70
OL,9,Ftrains that do not currently have them,
OL,10,FGTR added.
